# Carry extension (branch carry-extension-2026-08): notebook scratch output.
# carry/src/canonical.py redirects the canonical notebook's BBG_RESULTS here so a
# carry run can never overwrite the canonical results/ directory.
carry/results/_nb_scratch/

# Carry extension: carry_signal_curve.csv is EXACTLY DV01 x 100 x [(y-rf)h + (y-y_roll)].
# All yields in that bracket are public (FRED), so the file lets anyone back out Bloomberg's
# CONVENTIONAL_CTD_FORWARD_FRSK to 0.000000% error. Per DATA.md that field cannot be
# redistributed. Regenerate locally with: python carry/src/run_experiments.py
carry/results/carry_signal_curve.csv

# Carry extension: internal full-width pipeline outputs. run_experiments.py writes
# all 25 book-return series here for diagnostics.py / final_tests.py / make_figs.py,
# and publishes only the 7 verification columns to carry/results/book_returns_daily.csv
# so a reproduction run leaves the working tree clean.
carry/results/_internal/
